Scope / 适用范围

This grant covers newly authored Android Kotlin code and tests under app/src,
project build scripts, tests, and documentation. It does not relicense imported
code, artwork, model binaries, dependency code or derivatives of those materials.

Excluded from this grant: FaceSource/ and ReferenceSource/ (except the newly
written FaceSource/android-host.css); app/src/main/assets/face/ and generated
live-setup.json, scenarios.json, personality.json, idle-scenarios.json;
icon.png and generated launcher artwork; efficientdet_lite0.tflite;
gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar and upstream gradlew.

Imported eye/web material has no declared upstream license in the source
snapshot. No additional permission over that material is asserted here.
Third-party libraries, models and tools retain their own licenses. See NOTICE.md
and licenses/. No trademark license is granted.

